WEBVTT

00:00:05.748 --> 00:00:11.548
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.798 --> 00:00:16.394
Click Edit Staying Safe Online.

00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:22.644
Check that Before you publish
shows every step done.

00:00:24.496 --> 00:00:28.347
Click Publish.

00:00:28.597 --> 00:00:32.449
Click Publish now.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:38.363
Wait until you see Unpublish.

00:00:38.613 --> 00:00:43.811
Click Unpublish to hide the video again.

00:00:44.061 --> 00:00:48.390
Click Unpublish to confirm.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:54.168
Wait until you see Publish.
